· QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Perkataan kedua imam disajikan dalam bahasa Arab aslinya, apa adanya, beserta rujukannya.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibnul Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فأخبر الله تعالى أن كتابهم كتاب مرقوم تحقيقا لكونه مكتوبا كتابة حقيقية<cite>«حادي الأرواح إلى بلاد الأفراح» 1/70</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=id#s83a20\">Buka di tafsir interaktif (teks lengkap)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/id/ayah/83-16.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (83:16)</a><a href=\"/id/ayah/83-21.html\">Ayat berikutnya (83:21)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang proyek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; ketentuan</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/83-21.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"id\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Al-Mutaffifin 83:21 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"yang disaksikan oleh (malaikat-malaikat) yang didekatkan (kepada Allah).\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/83-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/83-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/83-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/83-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/83-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/83-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/83-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/83-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/83-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/83-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/83-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/83-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/83-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/83-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/83-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/83-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/83-21.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Al-Mutaffifin 83:21 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"yang disaksikan oleh (malaikat-malaikat) yang didekatkan (kepada Allah).\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> › <a href=\"/id/surah/83.html\">Surah Al-Mutaffifin</a> › Ayat 21</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Al-Mutaffifin 83:21</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿يَشْهَدُهُ الْمُقَرَّبُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemah makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">yang disaksikan oleh (malaikat-malaikat) yang didekatkan (kepada Allah).</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Indonesian Translation - Ministry of Religious Affairs — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Perkataan kedua imam disajikan dalam bahasa Arab aslinya, apa adanya, beserta rujukannya.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibnul Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وخص تعالى كتاب الأبرار بإنه يكتب ويوقع لهم به بمشهد المقربين من الملائكة والنبي صلى الله عليه وسلمين وسادات المؤمنين ولم يذكر شهادة هؤلاء لكتاب الفجار تنويها بكتاب الأبرار وما وقع لهم به وإشهارا له وإظهارا بين خواص خلقه<cite>«حادي الأرواح إلى بلاد الأفراح» 1/70</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=id#s83a21\">Buka di tafsir interaktif (teks lengkap)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/id/ayah/83-20.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (83:20)</a><a href=\"/id/ayah/83-23.html\">Ayat berikutnya (83:23)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang proyek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; ketentuan</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/83-23.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"id\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Al-Mutaffifin 83:23 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"mereka (duduk) di atas dipan-dipan melepas pandangan.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/83-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/83-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/83-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alt