 UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> › <a href=\"/id/surah/83.html\">Surah Al-Mutaffifin</a> › Ayat 23</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Al-Mutaffifin 83:23</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿عَلَى الْأَرَائِكِ يَنظُرُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemah makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">mereka (duduk) di atas dipan-dipan melepas pandangan.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Indonesian Translation - Ministry of Religious Affairs — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Perkataan kedua imam disajikan dalam bahasa Arab aslinya, apa adanya, beserta rujukannya.</p><section><h2>Syaikhul Islam Ibnu Taimiyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وقوله: {إن الأبرار لفي نعيم} {على الأرائك ينظرون} فإن هذا كله يعم الرجال والنساء.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 6/437</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=id#s83a23\">Buka di tafsir interaktif (teks lengkap)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/id/ayah/83-21.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (83:21)</a><a href=\"/id/ayah/83-27.html\">Ayat berikutnya (83:27)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang proyek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; ketentuan</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/83-27.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"id\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Al-Mutaffifin 83:27 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Dan campurannya dari tasnīm,\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/83-27.html\">\